〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p138a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d14756923d6ddfe2a00f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏武故事》载令曰：“领长史王必，是吾披荆棘时吏也。忠能勤事，心如铁石，国之良吏也；蹉跌久未辟之。舍骐骥而弗乘，焉遑遑而更求哉？故教辟之，已署所宜，便以领长史统事如故。”","attribution":"《魏武故事》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":417,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-362ca35735554da5080b","start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p139a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"时有京兆金祎，字德祎。自以世为汉臣，自日䃅讨莽何罗，忠诚显著，名节累叶。睹汉祚将移，谓可季兴；乃喟然发愤，遂与耿纪、韦晃、吉本、本子邈、邈弟穆等结谋。纪字季行。少有美名，为丞相掾，王甚敬异之。迁侍中，守少府。邈字文然，穆字思然；以祎慷慨有日!之风，又与王必善，因以间之。若杀必，欲挟天子以攻魏，南援刘备。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":13,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p139b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"时关羽强盛，而王在邺，留必典兵，督许中事。文然等率杂人及家僮千余人，夜烧门攻必。祎遣人为内应，射必中肩。必不知攻者为谁，以素与祎善，走投祎，夜唤‘德祎’。祎家不知是必，谓为文然等，错应曰：‘王长史已死乎？卿曹事立矣！’必乃更他路奔。一曰：必欲投祎，其帐下督谓必曰：‘今日事，竟知谁门而投入乎？’扶必奔南城。会天明，必犹在；文然等众散，故败。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":165,"end":335,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p139c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"后十余日，必竟以创死。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":335,"end":346,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p141a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31c17c088af3b732e0a","layer":"pei","quote":"《山阳公载记》曰：“王闻王必死，盛怒。召汉百官诣邺：令救火者左，不救火者右。众人以为救火者必无罪，皆附左。王以为：‘不救火者，非助乱；救火，乃实贼也！’皆杀之。”","attribution":"《山阳公载记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":420,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十三年：建安二十三年（公元 218）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8cae36984cdc22e48444","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o188","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1336d4803d0b76311776","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年春正月〖1〗，汉太医令吉本与少府耿纪、司直韦晃等反〖2〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p138","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d14756923d6ddfe2a00f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏武故事》载令曰：“领长史王必，是吾披荆棘时吏也。忠能勤事，心如铁石，国之良吏也；蹉跌久未辟之。舍骐骥而弗乘，焉遑遑而更求哉？故教辟之，已署所宜，便以领长史统事如故。”","attribution":"《魏武故事》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":417,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-362ca35735554da5080b","start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《三辅决录注》曰：“时有京兆金祎，字德祎。自以世为汉臣，自日䃅讨莽何罗，忠诚显著，名节累叶。睹汉祚将移，谓可季兴；乃喟然发愤，遂与耿纪、韦晃、吉本、本子邈、邈弟穆等结谋。纪字季行。少有美名，为丞相掾，王甚敬异之。迁侍中，守少府。邈字文然，穆字思然；以祎慷慨有日!之风，又与王必善，因以间之。若杀必，欲挟天子以攻魏，南援刘备。时关羽强盛，而王在邺，留必典兵，督许中事。文然等率杂人及家僮千余人，夜烧门攻必。祎遣人为内应，射必中肩。必不知攻者为谁，以素与祎善，走投祎，夜唤‘德祎’。祎家不知是必，谓为文然等，错应曰：‘王长史已死乎？卿曹事立矣！’必乃更他路奔。一曰：必欲投祎，其帐下督谓必曰：‘今日事，竟知谁门而投入乎？’扶必奔南城。会天明，必犹在；文然等众散，故败。后十余日，必竟以创死。”","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":347,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p141","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31c17c088af3b732e0a","layer":"pei","quote":"《山阳公载记》曰：“王闻王必死，盛怒。召汉百官诣邺：令救火者左，不救火者右。众人以为救火者必无罪，皆附左。王以为：‘不救火者，非助乱；救火，乃实贼也！’皆杀之。”","attribution":"《山阳公载记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":420,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-432df605c12becfbc358","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-de3f70d0362ef11d699c","layer":"pei","quote":"至二十二年，许中百官，矫制。遇虽不与谋，犹被录诣邺；转为冗散。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":514,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":114,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-5cf56c35fb780197d557","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-13f5b324b075457337f1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖领兖州牧，始遣使上书。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-878d1bf8336c290fd58d","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-13f5b324b075457337f1","layer":"original","quote":"繇说傕、汜等曰：“方今英雄并起，各矫命专制，唯曹兖州乃心王室；而逆其忠款〖7〗，非所以副将来之望也〖8〗。”傕、汜等用繇言，厚加答报；由是太祖使命遂得通。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-a071b78b3f7da0177c41","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-13f5b324b075457337f1","layer":"original","quote":"傕、汜等以为：“关东欲自立天子，今曹操虽有使命，非其至实〖6〗。”议留太祖使，拒绝其意。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-a12410b83b9a9a720138","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-ec534575c164b4a63dd0","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖遣使从事王必，致命天子。”","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4b1979437d8042ef9f9a","start":10,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
